//===========================================DT数据采集功能块，勿删/DT Data Collection Function，Do Not Delete============================================================
// CATL AG
// (c)Copyright 2025 All Rights Reserved
功能块使用注意项：
1）设备自动运行过程中无报警，主动按停止/打手动会触发外部条件S01.Condition[150]为True，HMI将弹出固定LOSS弹窗；
2）HMI LOSS不点选（即S01.Condition[150]为True），设备不允许启动；
3）Device_Alarm信号为PackML报警汇总信号，当设备自动运行信号Device_Running为True时，设备停机原因PackTags.Admin.FirstOutAlarm中不应该存有数值；（请注意报警等级配置）
4）请注意设备自动运行标志位Device_Running线圈前的信号链接&逻辑处理；

Notes on the use of Function Blocks：
1）During the automatic operation of the  equipment，there were no alarms. Press the Stop button or switch to manual mode，
      external condition signals <S01.Condition[150]> will be Triggered，and HMI will pop up the LOSS-Window;
2）HMI LOSS Do not Click(<S01.Condition[150] is True>)，the equipment is not allowed to be started;
3）Device_Alarm is the Packml alarm summary signal ,when the equipment is automatic , the signal of PackTags.Admin.FirstOutAlarm should not contain any numerical values;(Please Pay attention to the alarm setting )
4）Please pay attention to the signal connection and logical processing before the Device_Running of the signal coil.

//===========================================PPM参数下发功能块============================================================
//该功能块主要用于产生堵料、待料信号，依据设备自身情况自行链接信号；
//对于前工序设备，若此功能块不适用，可将其P_Off，自行输出待/堵料逻辑，然后将相应的待/堵料信号链接至上述HMI_Confirm_FC功能块对应的输入引脚；
//===========================================PPM Parameter Release Function Block============================================================
//The functional block is mainly used to generate jam and waiting signals, linking signals according to the equipment's own conditions;
//For the upstream equipment, if this function block is not applicable, you can P_Off it, output the pending/stuck logic yourself, and then link 
   the corresponding pending/stuck signal to the input pin corresponding to the above HMI_Confirm_FC function block;

